ull},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-05T12:52:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-08T18:30:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nVersion 4.5 beta 6\nVersion 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nI've been writing tooling to edit skeleton hierarchies for adding spring bone chains.  I wrote a script to autogenerate settings / bone chains based on naming conventions.  This however disables the collisions with existing spring bone collisions, I can get around this if I reparent those collisions under the spring bone simulation.  This also happens when manually adding chains.\n\nYou can reopen the scene to also fix the issue\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Add a spring bone collision to a spring bone simulation\n- Add a chain to the settings that would be effected by the spring bone collision\n- Adjust the spring bone collision to see if it effects the chain (it does not)\n- Fix A: Save and reopen the scene, collisions will be fixed\n- Fix B: Cut and paste the spring bone collision back into the simulation (it should now effect the chains)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mvp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22172300/mvp.zip)\nAdd a chain for Lower Shirt 0_0 - Lower Shirt 0_2","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110274/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110274/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}